  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 40.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðisses hwæt gelimpe, ðenden fyrd ute sie, oððe in lenctenfæsten, hit sie twybote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If something of this nature occurs while the army is out [on duty], or in the Lenten fast, it is double compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If any of these offences occur while the army is in the field, or during the fast of Lent, the compensation [to be paid] shall be double [the above].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðysses hwæt gelimpe, þonne fyrd ute sy, oþþe in lencten-fæsten, hit sy twybote.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
